# INT unit (#107): a template instantiates once per argument signature,
# up to 64 instances; a call with a new signature past the cap runs the
# base template dynamically (inferencer.cpp, D4), with a one-time warning
# on stderr. `aK` below is an array nested K deep - 66 calls, 66 distinct
# static types - so the last two run the base. Every engine must print
# what the tree-walker prints.

